WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:07.886
In this video, you will tour your profile: your saved drafts, your contests, the badges your home has won, and your account settings.

00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:08.846
We start on the map.

00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:11.470
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.363 --> 00:00:16.913
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.664 --> 00:00:19.644
Then tap Allow.

00:00:24.673 --> 00:00:27.176
Your profile is two taps from the map.

00:00:27.176 --> 00:00:31.394
Look at the top of the map, and tap your picture, or your initial, in the circle.

00:00:34.707 --> 00:00:37.764
The menu also has a row called Your events.

00:00:37.764 --> 00:00:42.060
It opens the events you added, where you can edit them and add photos.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.793
We cover that in its own video.

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:46.204
For now, tap Your profile.

00:00:48.239 --> 00:00:49.795
This is your profile.

00:00:49.795 --> 00:00:55.064
At the top is your picture, or your initial, with a button to add or change your photo.

00:00:55.064 --> 00:01:01.569
Below it, Drafts lists anything you started and saved, like an event or a contest you did not finish.

00:01:01.569 --> 00:01:05.804
Because it is saved to your account, you can finish it later, on any device.

00:01:08.323 --> 00:01:09.455
Tap Contests.

00:01:11.386 --> 00:01:21.967
This lists the contests you run, with buttons to manage each one or view its page, and below that, the homes you entered in other people's contests, with where each one stands.

00:01:21.967 --> 00:01:25.131
Displays, the next tab, lists the homes you posted.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:26.854
Tap Events.

00:01:28.842 --> 00:01:35.043
These are the events you added, and each one has buttons to edit it, add photos, or run it again next year.

00:01:35.913 --> 00:01:36.913
Tap Badges.

00:01:38.809 --> 00:01:43.499
When your home wins a contest, it earns a badge, and a crown on the map.

00:01:43.499 --> 00:01:47.005
All the awards your home has won are listed here, from every year.

00:01:47.861 --> 00:01:48.764
Tap Account.

00:01:50.605 --> 00:01:53.877
This is where you change your name, city, and address.

00:01:53.877 --> 00:01:58.410
They are optional, they fill in forms for you, and they are never shown publicly.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:07.236
You can also choose the monthly update email, sign out, and, at the bottom, delete your account, along with everything tied to it, if you ever want to.

00:02:08.118 --> 00:02:13.287
That is your profile: your drafts, your contests, your badges, and your account.

00:02:13.287 --> 00:02:18.877
If you ever need help, there is a Help Center in the menu, with written steps for everything in these videos.

00:02:20.242 --> 00:02:22.177
Next up: Vote in a contest.
